Blissverktyget (WinBliss²) — licenser / licenses

Projektet består av fyra delar med olika licenser.
This project has four parts under different licenses.


1. Koden / The code
   Allt utom innehållet i workbench/js/data/ och workbench/fonts/ och filerna i del 4
   — sidorna, ritmotorn (workbench/js/engine/, porterad från WinBliss Bliss_Common),
   editorn, de delade skripten, verktygen i tools/ och ikonerna.
   Everything except the contents of workbench/js/data/ and workbench/fonts/ and the
   files in part 4.

   Copyright © 2026 AnyCom AB
   Ritmotorn ursprungligen / original engine: © AnyCom AB / P-O Hedvall

   Licens: Creative Commons Erkännande 4.0 Internationell (CC BY 4.0)
   License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Fullständig licenstext / legal code:
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

   Du får dela och bearbeta koden, även kommersiellt, om du anger
   upphovet (AnyCom AB), länkar till licensen och anger om du har ändrat.
   You may share and adapt the code, also commercially, if you credit
   AnyCom AB, link to the license and indicate if changes were made.


2. Blissymbolerna och ordlistorna / The Bliss symbols and glosses
   workbench/js/data/bliss-data.js (symbolerna, BCI-AV)
   workbench/js/data/glosses.js (översättningarna / translated glosses)

   Blissymbolics © C.K. Bliss 1949, 1965.
   Symbolerna © Blissymbolics Communication International (BCI).
   Följer BCI:s auktoriserade ordförråd / conforming to the
   BCI Authorized Vocabulary (BCI-AV). https://www.blissymbolics.org

   Licens: Creative Commons Erkännande-DelaLika 4.0 Internationell (CC BY-SA 4.0)
   License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
   Fullständig licenstext / legal code:
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

   Den som sprider symbolerna, eller något som bygger på dem, ska ange
   BCI och dela det under samma licens.
   Anyone distributing the symbols, or work built on them, must credit
   BCI and share it under the same license.


3. Typsnittet / The typeface
   workbench/fonts/ (Atkinson Hyperlegible Next och Atkinson Hyperlegible Mono)

   Copyright 2020-2024 The Atkinson Hyperlegible Next Project Authors
   Copyright 2020-2024 The Atkinson Hyperlegible Mono Project Authors
   Ursprungligen / originally: Braille Institute of America.

   Licens / License: SIL Open Font License 1.1
   Licenstext / license text: workbench/fonts/OFL-next.txt, workbench/fonts/OFL-mono.txt
   https://openfontlicense.org

   Typsnittet ligger i appen i stället för att hämtas från Google Fonts,
   så att ingen besökares IP-adress skickas till någon annan.
   The typeface is served by the app instead of Google Fonts, so no
   visitor's IP address is sent to a third party.


4. Skrivreglerna, synonymerna och ordfrekvenserna / The writing rules, synonyms and word frequencies
   Från Bliss-glosor (https://github.com/johbom/blissmaiker), hämtade med tools/build-skriv.js.
   From Bliss-glosor, brought in by tools/build-skriv.js.

   workbench/js/shared/bliss-skriv.js (skrivreglerna / the writing rules)
     Copyright © 2026 John Säbom. Licens / License: MIT
     Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of
     this software and associated documentation files, to deal in the Software
     without restriction, subject to the copyright notice and this permission
     notice being included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.
     THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND.
     Fullständig text / full text: https://opensource.org/license/mit

   workbench/js/shared/bliss-grammar.js (grammatikmotorn / the grammar engine)
     Portad från BlissEngine (Grammar, composeSentence) © AnyCom AB, CC BY 4.0, av John Säbom.
     Indikatorerna i filen / the indicators in it © BCI, CC BY-SA 4.0 (se del 2 / see part 2).

   workbench/js/data/bliss-synonymer.js (synonymer / synonyms)
     Urval ur Swesaurus, © Språkbanken Text, Göteborgs universitet.
     Selection from Swesaurus, © Språkbanken Text, University of Gothenburg.
     Licens / License: CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

   workbench/js/data/bliss-harledda.js (härledda verb / derived verbs) och
   workbench/js/data/bliss-skriv-data.js (ordfrekvenser / word frequencies)
     Verben och frekvenserna ur SUC 3.0-statistik, © Språkbanken Text, Göteborgs universitet.
     The verbs and frequencies from SUC 3.0 statistics, © Språkbanken Text, University of Gothenburg.
     Licens / License: CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
     BCI-id och ord i filerna / the BCI ids and words in them: se del 2 / see part 2.
